{"id":10375,"slug":"10375-enum-trong-active-record-la-gi-cach-dinh-nghia-va-dung-trong-query","category":"Rails","subcategory":"Migration & DB","level":"advanced","question_vi":"Enum trong Active Record là gì? Cách định nghĩa và dùng trong query?","question_en":"What is an Enum in Active Record? How do you define and use it in queries?","answer_vi":"Enum map integer trong DB thành tên có nghĩa trong Ruby — giúp code đọc rõ hơn và tiết kiệm storage.\n\n```ruby\n# Migration\nadd_column :orders, :status, :integer, default: 0\n\n# Model (Rails 7+ dùng hash syntax)\nclass Order < ApplicationRecord\n  enum :status, { pending: 0, processing: 1, shipped: 2, delivered: 3, cancelled: 4 }\nend\n\n# Generated methods:\norder.pending?    # => true/false\norder.processing! # update status = 1 ngay lập tức\nOrder.shipped     # scope: WHERE status = 2\norder.status      # => \"pending\" (string)\n```\n\n**Lưu ý:** dùng `_prefix:` hoặc `_suffix:` khi có nhiều enum trên cùng model để tránh conflict method name:\n\n```ruby\nenum :status,   { active: 0, archived: 1 }, _prefix: :status\nenum :category, { active: 0, inactive: 1 }, _prefix: :category\n# → status_active?, category_active?\n```","answer_en":"Enums map DB integers to meaningful names in Ruby — cleaner code and reduced storage.\n\n```ruby\n# Migration\nadd_column :orders, :status, :integer, default: 0\n\n# Model (Rails 7+ hash syntax)\nclass Order < ApplicationRecord\n  enum :status, { pending: 0, processing: 1, shipped: 2, delivered: 3, cancelled: 4 }\nend\n\n# Generated methods:\norder.pending?    # => true/false\norder.processing! # updates status = 1 immediately\nOrder.shipped     # scope: WHERE status = 2\norder.status      # => \"pending\" (string)\n```\n\n**Note:** use `_prefix:` or `_suffix:` when a model has multiple enums to avoid method name collisions:\n\n```ruby\nenum :status,   { active: 0, archived: 1 }, _prefix: :status\nenum :category, { active: 0, inactive: 1 }, _prefix: :category\n# → status_active?, category_active?\n```","answer_html_vi":"<p>Enum map integer trong DB thành tên có nghĩa trong Ruby — giúp code đọc rõ hơn và tiết kiệm storage.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">ruby</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"# Migration\nadd_column :orders, :status, :integer, default: 0\n\n# Model (Rails 7+ dùng hash syntax)\nclass Order &lt; ApplicationRecord\n  enum :status, { pending: 0, processing: 1, shipped: 2, delivered: 3, cancelled: 4 }\nend\n\n# Generated methods:\norder.pending?    # =&gt; true/false\norder.processing! # update status = 1 ngay lập tức\nOrder.shipped     # scope: WHERE status = 2\norder.status      # =&gt; &quot;pending&quot; (string)\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Migration</span>\nadd_column <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:orders</span>, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:status</span>, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:integer</span>, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">default:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Model (Rails 7+ dùng hash syntax)</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Order</span> &lt; <span class=\"hljs-title class_ inherited__\">ApplicationRecord</span>\n  enum <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:status</span>, { <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">pending:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">processing:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">shipped:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">delivered:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span>, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">cancelled:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">4</span> }\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">end</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Generated methods:</span>\norder.pending?    <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># =&gt; true/false</span>\norder.processing! <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># update status = 1 ngay lập tức</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Order</span>.shipped     <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># scope: WHERE status = 2</span>\norder.status      <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># =&gt; &quot;pending&quot; (string)</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> dùng <code>_prefix:</code> hoặc <code>_suffix:</code> khi có nhiều enum trên cùng model để tránh conflict method name:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">ruby</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"enum :status,   { active: 0, archived: 1 }, _prefix: :status\nenum :category, { active: 0, inactive: 1 }, _prefix: :category\n# → status_active?, category_active?\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">enum <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:status</span>,   { <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">active:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">archived:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span> }, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">_prefix:</span> <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:status</span>\nenum <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:category</span>, { <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">active:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">inactive:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span> }, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">_prefix:</span> <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:category</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># → status_active?, category_active?</span></code></pre></div>","answer_html_en":"<p>Enums map DB integers to meaningful names in Ruby — cleaner code and reduced storage.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">ruby</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"# Migration\nadd_column :orders, :status, :integer, default: 0\n\n# Model (Rails 7+ hash syntax)\nclass Order &lt; ApplicationRecord\n  enum :status, { pending: 0, processing: 1, shipped: 2, delivered: 3, cancelled: 4 }\nend\n\n# Generated methods:\norder.pending?    # =&gt; true/false\norder.processing! # updates status = 1 immediately\nOrder.shipped     # scope: WHERE status = 2\norder.status      # =&gt; &quot;pending&quot; (string)\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Migration</span>\nadd_column <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:orders</span>, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:status</span>, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:integer</span>, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">default:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Model (Rails 7+ hash syntax)</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Order</span> &lt; <span class=\"hljs-title class_ inherited__\">ApplicationRecord</span>\n  enum <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:status</span>, { <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">pending:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">processing:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">shipped:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">delivered:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span>, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">cancelled:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">4</span> }\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">end</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Generated methods:</span>\norder.pending?    <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># =&gt; true/false</span>\norder.processing! <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># updates status = 1 immediately</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Order</span>.shipped     <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># scope: WHERE status = 2</span>\norder.status      <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># =&gt; &quot;pending&quot; (string)</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Note:</strong> use <code>_prefix:</code> or <code>_suffix:</code> when a model has multiple enums to avoid method name collisions:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">ruby</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"enum :status,   { active: 0, archived: 1 }, _prefix: :status\nenum :category, { active: 0, inactive: 1 }, _prefix: :category\n# → status_active?, category_active?\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">enum <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:status</span>,   { <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">active:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">archived:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span> }, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">_prefix:</span> <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:status</span>\nenum <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:category</span>, { <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">active:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">inactive:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span> }, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">_prefix:</span> <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:category</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># → status_active?, category_active?</span></code></pre></div>","references":[{"label":"Rails Guides — Active Record — Enums","url":"https://a